{"seq":10,"slug":"lc0056-merge-intervals","title":"LeetCode 56 合并区间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0056-merge-intervals","wordCount":860,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-56-合并区间\">LeetCode 56 合并区间</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>以数组 <code>intervals</code> 表示若干个区间的集合，其中单个区间为 <code>intervals[i] = [starti, endi]</code>。请你合并所有重叠的区间，并返回一个不重叠的区间数组，该数组需恰好覆盖输入中的所有区间。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= intervals.length &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n<li><code>intervals[i].length == 2</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= starti &lt;= endi &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：intervals = [[1,3],[2,6],[8,10],[15,18]]&#10;输出：[[1,6],[8,10],[15,18]]&#10;解释：区间 [1,3] 和 [2,6] 重叠，将它们合并为 [1,6]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：intervals = [[1,3],[2,6],[8,10],[15,18]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[[1,6],[8,10],[15,18]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：区间 [1,3] 和 [2,6] 重叠，将它们合并为 [1,6]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：intervals = [[1,4],[4,5]]&#10;输出：[[1,5]]&#10;解释：区间 [1,4] 和 [4,5] 可被视为重叠区间\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：intervals = [[1,4],[4,5]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[[1,5]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：区间 [1,4] 和 [4,5] 可被视为重叠区间</span></span></code></pre></div><p>区间合并是一类经典的贪心问题，在实际工程中应用广泛：日历系统的时间冲突检测、数据库的范围查询优化、网络流量的时间窗口合并等都会用到区间合并的思想。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"排序是关键\">排序是关键</h3><p>区间合并的核心策略：<strong>先按起始位置排序，再线性扫描合并</strong>。</p>\n<p>排序后，重叠的区间一定是相邻的。对于排序后的区间序列，如果当前区间的起始位置大于上一个合并区间的结束位置，说明没有重叠，开始一个新区间；否则，更新合并区间的结束位置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重叠的判断\">重叠的判断</h3><p>两个区间 <code>[a, b]</code> 和 <code>[c, d]</code>（假设 <code>a ≤ c</code>）的关系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>合并结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不重叠</td>\n<td>c &gt; b</td>\n<td>两个独立区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分重叠</td>\n<td>a ≤ c ≤ b &lt; d</td>\n<td>[a, d]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全包含</td>\n<td>a ≤ c 且 d ≤ b</td>\n<td>[a, b]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端点相接</td>\n<td>c = b</td>\n<td>[a, d]</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>排序后只需比较 <code>intervals[i][0]</code> 与上一个合并区间的 <code>end</code>：如果 <code>start &gt; end</code>，不重叠；否则合并（取 <code>end</code> 的较大值）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算法步骤\">算法步骤</h3><ol>\n<li>按区间起始位置排序</li>\n<li>初始化结果数组，放入第一个区间</li>\n<li>遍历后续区间：<ul>\n<li>如果当前区间与结果数组最后一个区间重叠，合并（更新 end）</li>\n<li>否则，将当前区间加入结果数组</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function merge(intervals: number[][]): number[][] {&#10;  intervals.sort((a, b) =&gt; a[0] - b[0]);&#10;&#10;  const result: number[][] = [intervals[0]];&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; intervals.length; i++) {&#10;    const last = result[result.length - 1];&#10;    const current = intervals[i];&#10;&#10;    if (current[0] &lt;= last[1]) {&#10;      last[1] = Math.max(last[1], current[1]);&#10;    } else {&#10;      result.push(current);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">intervals</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  intervals.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [intervals[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intervals.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> last</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result[result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intervals[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      last[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(last[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], current[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>执行过程示例：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>intervals = [[1,3],[2,6],[8,10],[15,18]]</code> 为例：</p>\n<p>排序后（已有序）：<code>[[1,3],[2,6],[8,10],[15,18]]</code></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>current</th>\n<th>last</th>\n<th>关系</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>result</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>放入 [1,3]</td>\n<td>[[1,3]]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>[2,6]</td>\n<td>[1,3]</td>\n<td>2≤3，重叠</td>\n<td>合并→[1,6]</td>\n<td>[[1,6]]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>[8,10]</td>\n<td>[1,6]</td>\n<td>8&gt;6，不重叠</td>\n<td>新增</td>\n<td>[[1,6],[8,10]]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>[15,18]</td>\n<td>[8,10]</td>\n<td>15&gt;10，不重叠</td>\n<td>新增</td>\n<td>[[1,6],[8,10],[15,18]]</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以 <code>intervals = [[1,4],[0,4]]</code> 为例（需要排序）：</p>\n<p>排序后：<code>[[0,4],[1,4]]</code></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>current</th>\n<th>last</th>\n<th>关系</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>result</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>放入 [0,4]</td>\n<td>[[0,4]]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>[1,4]</td>\n<td>[0,4]</td>\n<td>1≤4，重叠</td>\n<td>max(4,4)=4</td>\n<td>[[0,4]]</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"处理完全包含的情况\">处理完全包含的情况</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"区间 A: [1, 10]&#10;区间 B: [3, 5]   （被 A 完全包含）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>区间 A: [1, 10]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>区间 B: [3, 5]   （被 A 完全包含）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>由于 <code>3 ≤ 10</code>，会触发合并逻辑。<code>max(10, 5) = 10</code>，结果仍然是 <code>[1, 10]</code>，正确处理了完全包含的情况。</p>\n<h3 id=\"插入区间的变体\">插入区间的变体</h3><p>如果需要向已排序的区间列表中插入一个新区间并合并（LC #57），可以用类似的逻辑：找到插入位置，然后向前向后扩展合并。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function insert(intervals: number[][], newInterval: number[]): number[][] {&#10;  const result: number[][] = [];&#10;  let i = 0;&#10;  const n = intervals.length;&#10;&#10;  while (i &lt; n &amp;&amp; intervals[i][1] &lt; newInterval[0]) {&#10;    result.push(intervals[i]);&#10;    i++;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  while (i &lt; n &amp;&amp; intervals[i][0] &lt;= newInterval[1]) {&#10;    newInterval[0] = Math.min(newInterval[0], intervals[i][0]);&#10;    newInterval[1] = Math.max(newInterval[1], intervals[i][1]);&#10;    i++;&#10;  }&#10;  result.push(newInterval);&#10;&#10;  while (i &lt; n) {&#10;    result.push(intervals[i]);&#10;    i++;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">intervals</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newInterval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</s